          "id": "checkpoint_e6bb9be7402ae4de632e47a2",
          "next": "Read linked ACCEPTANCE.json and handoff.json first, then the latest public documentation and linked post-restart recovery report. Use their current evidence and exact remaining blockers to continue. Complete verified human Auth setup: configure and verify the intended production redirect flow and production email delivery, then run the relevant end-to-end account/session checks with authorized configuration. Preserve current deployments, frozen releases, execution receipts and recovery fingerprints. Plan the still-NOT_RUN independent cross-provider continuation, Oracle ARM inventory/isolated-worker validation and cross-project disaster restore as separate evidence-backed work. Keep public authored JS/TS/Python disabled until verified isolation exists. Use existing reconstruction/formal-contract evidence to select remaining work; graph statuses require substantive requirement evidence before any promotion. Record exact PASS/FAIL/BLOCKED/NOT_RUN scope and a new checkpoint after each material result.",
